  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/670ca9d5a56e4ce950895ee7736a9ac263e8afca\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/670ca9d5a56e4ce950895ee7736a9ac263e8afca\" data-orgin-width=\"2016\" data-origin-height=\"1512\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이실험에서 뜨거운물 속에 차가운물을넣고 열평형실험인데요   </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40a3f9db1d22613c287b4cccb0eac7aab9e1f4dc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40a3f9db1d22613c287b4cccb0eac7aab9e1f4dc\" data-orgin-width=\"2016\" data-origin-height=\"1512\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">열평형온도를 보면 차가운물의 온도변화가 더 적게나타나는데요 <br>물의양은 따뜻한물이 더많아보이는데 왜 저렇게 나타나는건가요<br>잃어버린열량=얻은열량 식을 봐도 이해가안가서요ㅜㅜ<br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
